{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9e8b2c23e0545ef6de81f0ea578173e9ab7a64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEF$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is inscribed in equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e14341e2a99fcee1b7d7c0697fed0e7b747eb4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE} \\perp \\overline{BC}$\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />. The ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/872e3b09425c9659d782119a543dc858aa520a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEF$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db5a1dc04a55103c1065f122eb2afb02158574a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ \\frac {1}{6} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ \\frac {1}{4} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ \\frac {1}{3} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ \\frac {2}{5} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ \\frac {1}{2} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"361\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4ea52b08e9988bf4c02b3ca44e919efbf3c5d93c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]draw((0,0)--(3,0)); draw((0,0)--(1.5, 2.59807621)); draw((3,0)--(1.5, 2.59807621));  draw((1,0)--(1, 1.73205081)); draw((1,0)--(2.5, 0.866025404)); draw((1, 1.73205081)--(2.5, 0.866025404));[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p>Let's take one of the smaller right triangles. Without loss of generality, let the smaller leg be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since the triangle is a 30-60-90 right triangle, then the other leg is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c77cf4b63af80bfbc6a9ad9b4b9e8e549e77d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> and the hypotenuse is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The side length of the bigger triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/d/9bdcc9ee7482c144aff5368c1b69d2e15c2d65ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> and the side length of the smaller triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c77cf4b63af80bfbc6a9ad9b4b9e8e549e77d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />. The ratio of the areas of two similar triangles is the square of the ratio of two corresponding side lengths, so the ratio of the area of triangle DEF to the area of triangle ABC is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c374e80e689b8f08cc0e5e58d925a3693f699b64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{1}{3} \\rightarrow (C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"156\" height=\"56\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSM